    <title>intervention_element_thr_by_index</title>
    <description>@0x1ce634 (file +0x4e434). Three 9-u16 rows (contiguous, 0x12-byte row stride) starting exactly on the tune's edit grid. Stock rows repeat the motif 1700, 6500, 1700 twice with a 3-value tail (row 0 3000/3000/3000, row 1 0/0/0, row 2 6500/6500/6500); the tune rewrites 12 cells that stock at 1700 to 6500/4500/3500/3000. Reader unknown; row stride inferred from the edits. Confidence LOW.</description>
