  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1198" flags="0x0">
    <title>gear_display_digit_rule</title>
    <description>@0x1914c8 (file +0x112c8). Four contiguous 8-byte records (stride 8): each stock record reads 00 03 03 03 00 00 00 vv with vv = 04 for records 0-2 and 08 for record 3; the tune sets byte 0 of every record 0x00 -&gt; 0x03. Byte 0 is the per-object display-source selector read by disp_gear_digit_select 0xafc12 via FUN_0009acf0 (*(u8*)(obj+4+idx)): observed 0 = no digit, 1 = raw fff895f3, 2 = raw fff895f4, 3 = gear number 1..8 (disp_manual_gear_digit 0xafbf8). The earlier single-value emissions at 0x1914C4/0x1914D4 read the tail of records 0/2 and are superseded by this item.</description>
